{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1729070,\"title\":\"Eric Church - Live at Red Rocks Amphitheatre 7-07-2026\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"July 7th: Eric Church performs live at Red Rocks Amphitheatre\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gew3daAlICAGxeOGdoQIXqii3bl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qggQZ5zG3ZY6bibPFFBbhnSsGFj.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":137,\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Nugsnet\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5593023,\"name\":\"Nugsnet\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593032,\"name\":\"Eric Church\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593013,\"name\":\"Driver Williams\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593017,\"name\":\"Jeff Cease\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593018,\"name\":\"Jeff Hyde\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593019,\"name\":\"Lee Hendricks\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593020,\"name\":\"Craig Wright\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5593021,\"name\":\"Joanna Cotten\",\"character\":\"Herself\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354912,\"title\":\"Coco\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7CHF8gTLGooTbP4GznIGwaqAGL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel's family history.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":936075,\"title\":\"Michael\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dueFqKLvjftnELZaGYwY7xinfaI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":244786,\"title\":\"Whiplash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Under the direction of a ruthless instructor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":803796,\"title\":\"KPop Demon Hunters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren't selling out stadiums, they're using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":335797,\"title\":\"Sing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwopfpHqPCYBSgBuZwkaXXqHp14.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z9ft5HYHzWcasR6SGcgeluxTznB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A koala named Buster recruits his best friend to help him drum up business for his theater by hosting a singing competition.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1340206,\"title\":\"Tuner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5OvA3i9wZs5jHu0DCrfmXlzAM67.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y04gpYp8rJoUud6vf8okqHIdP4V.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A gifted piano tuner's meticulous skills for tuning pianos lead him to discover an unexpected aptitude for cracking safes, turning his life upside down.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Romance\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776503,\"title\":\"CODA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/BzVjmm8l23rPsijLiNLUzuQtyd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v85FlkbMYKa5du1glm0YfYNsL2n.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family's fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":424694,\"title\":\"Bohemian Rhapsody\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lHu1wtNaczFPGFDTrjCSzeLPTKN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcvbs8z0GEXslC1kCT77x19XDeR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Singer Freddie Mercury, guitarist Brian May, drummer Roger Taylor and bass guitarist John Deacon take the music world by storm when they form the rock 'n' roll band Queen in 1970. Hit songs become instant classics. When Mercury's increasingly wild lifestyle starts to spiral out of control, Queen soon faces its greatest challenge yet – finding a way to keep the band together amid the success and excess.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":468776,\"title\":\"BABYMETAL Live LEGEND 1999 - APOCALYPSE\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/163geBUCKYhep0xie0AjyaOXDx9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8jWbOxUuiiAdkMupEK3ko2pTiRz.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"LEGEND \\\"1999\\\" YUIMETAL & MOAMETAL Birthday Festival (LEGEND \\\"1999\\\" YUIMETAL & MOAMETAL 聖誕祭; LEGEND \\\"1999\\\" YUIMETAL & MOAMETAL Seitansai) was a concert held on June 30, 2013 at NHK Hall in Tokyo, Japan.  This show celebrated the 14th birthdays of YUIMETAL and MOAMETAL.  The concert started with BABYBONES, followed by the appearance of the KAMI BAND beginning with NO RAIN, NO RAINBOW. At the concert's end, it was announced that the LEGEND \\\"1997\\\" SU-METAL Birthday Festival would be held on December 21st.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"XKXTJXH9rRQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ce3Jn5r8_5w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gNNT9oXvZtc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}